 and Staff Directory"], ["https://www.seoulforeign.org/about/history", "History"], ["https://www.seoulforeign.org/about/safeguarding", "Child Protection and Safeguarding"], ["https://www.seoulforeign.org/academics/early-years-program", "Welcome to the Early Years at SFS!"]], "skipped": [["nav @nav.#", 1988], ["[aria-hidden=\"true\"] @article.fsResource fsStyleAutoclear fsResourceTy#", 1314], ["[aria-hidden=\"true\"] @section.fsElement fsContent infographics-popup i#", 1245], ["[aria-hidden=\"true\"] @article.fsFeeds-post slick-slide slick-cloned#", 1004], ["script @script.#", 921], ["[role=menu] @ul.fsNavLevel2#", 722], ["[aria-hidden=\"true\"] @figcaption.slick-slide slick-cloned#", 429], ["[aria-hidden=\"true\"] @section.fsElement fsContent infographics-popup i#slick-slide22", 393]], "sample": "", "role": "home"}, {"url": "https://www.seoulforeign.org/about/mission-and-values", "title": "Mission and Values - Seoul Foreign School", "lang": "en-US", "vh": 900, "blocks": [[16, "a", -48, 1, 0, "Skip To Main Content"], [16, "a", 72, 1, 1, "Seoul Foreign School"], [13, "h2", 204, 1, 1, "In This Section"], [70, "h2", 659, 1, 1, "Mission and Values"], [40, "h1", 783, 1, 0, "Our Mission and Values"], [26, "p", 881, 1, 0, "Mission Seoul Foreign School, Centered in Christ, inspires a passion for learning, pursues academic and creative excellence and is dedicated to the service of others."], [26, "p", 963, 0, 0, "Christ-like Attitudes Love, Faith, Service, Self-Control, Compassion, Acceptance, Forgiveness, Integrity, Hope, Joy"], [26, "p", 1045, 0, 0, "A Christian school for everyone SFS enrolls students from all religious backgrounds and welcomes all as integral members of our diverse community. “Centered in Christ” means that our community lives, works, and builds relationships following the example of Christ himself."], [26, "p", 1154, 0, 0, "Seoul Foreign School Belonging Statement As a Christ-centered school, we are committed to loving our neighbors as ourselves. SFS chooses to respect the dignity of every human being and aspires to be a school where all are known, cared for, belong, and thrive."], [16, "p", 1262, 0, 0, "SFS responds to each community member's needs, regardless of their race, religion, beliefs, sex, gender identity, sexual orientation, cultural background, learning differences, or any other aspects of their personal identity."], [16, "p", 1334, 0, 0, "All policies, procedures, and practices are regularly reviewed and developed to this aim."], [18, "p", 1380, 0, 0, "Seoul Foreign School Guiding Statements"], [26, "p", 1612, 0, 0, "Mission in Action"], [16, "p", 1674, 0, 0, "The Mission in Action is a clear articulation of the SFS Mission Statement as a process, encapsulating all we do as a school. The Mission in Action links the Christ-Like Attitudes to ‘Inspiring a Passion for Learning and Pursuing Academic and Creative Excellence’ through existing curricular and co-curricular programs, leading to ‘Service of Others’ and impacting our communities."], [20, "h2", 2751, 0, 1, "Dedicated to the service of others"], [20, "h2", 2751, 0, 1, "Pursuing Academic and Creative Excellence"], [20, "h2", 2751, 0, 1, "Inspiring a Passion for Learning"], [20, "h2", 3044, 0, 1, "Making an Impact"], [20, "h2", 3031, 0, 1, "Inspiring Excellence, Building Character"], [20, "h2", 3031, 0, 1, "Attitudes to Action, Empathy to Impact"], [40, "h2", 3273, 0, 1, "Testimonials"], [20, "p", 3322, 0, 1, "Applying our mission in action"], [15, "cite", 3505, 0, 0, "Rafael Jimenez , Learning Support Specialist, EAL Teacher, Design Teacher"], [14, "p", 3601, 0, 0, "Last week in our co-teaching I&S class, we had an activity with students understanding story plots. They did an amazing job representing their favorite books!"], [15, "cite", 3483, 0, 0, "Mike Knox , Grade 8 Language & Literature and Individuals & Societies Teacher"], [14, "p", 3579, 0, 0, "Our Grade 8 trip to Chiang Mai, when we take the whole class to northern Thailand. Though we only have 1 day that is dedicated to community service, the whole trip's aim is to create better human beings of our students."], [15, "cite", 3527, 0, 0, "Caleb Hill , Elementary Physical and Health Education"], [14, "p", 3601, 0, 0, "The Aquatics team had not been able to teach in the pool for many months so they decided to bring the pool to the students!"], [24, "h2", 3996, 0, 1, "Service-Learning"], [14, "div", 4394, 0, 0, "Early Years - Taking Responsibility and Protecting Our Plants"], [14, "div", 4394, 0, 0, "Kindergarten - Bokashi Composting"], [14, "div", 4394, 0, 0, "BS Year 1/2 - Our Earth, Our Home"], [14, "div", 4394, 0, 0, "IMYC - British School Social Leaders Projects"], [42, "figcaption", 4703, 0, 0, "Inspiring excellence, building character"]], "links": [["https://www.seoulforeign.org/about/mission-and-values", "Skip To Main Content"], ["https://www.seoulforeign.org/about", "About"], ["https://www.seoulforeign.org/about/welcome", "Welcome"], ["https://www.seoulforeign.org/about/mission-and-values", "Mission and Values"], ["https://www.seoulforeign.org/about/leadership", "Senior Leadership Team"], ["https://www.seoulforeign.org/about/governance", "Governance"], ["https://www.seoulforeign.org/about/accreditation", "Accreditation and Affiliations"], ["https://www.seoulforeign.org/about/directory", "Faculty and Staff Directory"], ["https://www.seoulforeign.org/about/history", "History"], ["https://www.seoulforeign.org/about/safeguarding", "Child Protection and Safeguarding"], ["https://www.seoulforeign.org/academics/early-years-program", "Welcome to the Early Years at SFS!"], ["https://www.seoulforeign.org/about", "About"], ["https://www.seoulforeign.org/about/welcome", "Welcome"], ["https://www.seoulforeign.org/about/mission-and-values", "Mission and Values"], ["https://www.seoulforeign.org/about/leadership", "Senior Leadership Team"], ["https://www.seoulforeign.org/about/governance", "Governance"], ["https://www.seoulforeign.org/about/accreditation", "Accre